@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Proposed — Authorized cache-aside read: hit, miss and outage
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Caller
participant "Owner / Sharing boundary" as H
database "Current authority + exact version source" as D
participant "Optional derived cache" as C
participant "Owner data / Files capability" as S
Caller -> H : exact resource / representation / language request
H -> D : current eligibility + version under actual admission contract
alt denied / authority unavailable
 H --> Caller : safe refusal; no old-allow fallback
else current eligible request
 H -> C : exact scoped/versioned key, if actual cache exists
 alt matching hit
  C --> H : candidate payload + exact provenance
  H -> H : validate current eligibility / exact usable identity before delivery
 else miss / cache unavailable
  H -> S : authorized exact owner projection / usable artifact
  S --> H : actual result or unavailable
  opt safe usable result and population permitted
   H -> C : populate only exact scope/version; handle stale-fill race
  end
 end
 H --> Caller : permitted exact output or truthful unavailable
end

@enduml